  "rawText": "Date of Birth: June 12, 1916 Place of Birth: Enfield, North Carolina Date of Death: September 1, 1990 Mother’s Name: Pearl Clanton Francis Father’s Name: James Henry Francis Birth Order: Sixth child of fourteen children Eddie, better known as “Bud”, lived in the Enfield area all of his life. He attended elementary school and joined the Daniel's Chapel Baptist Church at a young age where he was very active in church work and Sunday School. He served as Sunday School superintendent for several years. Bud was an agricultural farmer by profession. However, he was also an active carpenter, trapper, hunter and fisherman. After he ceased farming, Bud marketed vegetables and fruits. Bud had eleven children: Celestine, Shirley. Ell‘vood, Pearl, David, Rufus, Erdine, Edna, Jeanette, Jacqueline, and Donald. Shirley, Elwood and Celestine proceeded him in death. eer 2 Sh he oh F SC . . % =\" \\",
